{"logId": "fffff57a-b72a-4a02-939d-c45a2a3f392d", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "企业准则：扬善·戒恶", "block_bbox": [165, 141, 395, 167], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [395.0, 141.0], [395.0, 167.0], [165.0, 167.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "善与恶都是人性中真实共存的，是一种自然状态，或是在不同的社会文化背景中所形成的、潜移默化到每个人身上的个性特征！", "block_bbox": [164, 217, 1015, 269], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 217.0], [1015.0, 217.0], [1015.0, 269.0], [164.0, 269.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "当我们重视和专注于自身的优点，尽情地释放和体现美丽的、“善”的一面时，身上的不足就被慢慢淡化了，生命的缺点也就被稀释、被边缘化了！因此，我们倡导并践行“生命在于释放而非修行”！", "block_bbox": [164, 275, 1015, 329], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 275.0], [1015.0, 275.0], [1015.0, 329.0], [164.0, 329.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "扬善：公平、自由、尊重、信任、真诚、阳光、勇敢、正义、博爱、节制", "block_bbox": [198, 364, 951, 391], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 364.0], [951.0, 364.0], [951.0, 391.0], [198.0, 391.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "善——", "block_bbox": [201, 424, 275, 447], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 424.0], [274.0, 424.0], [274.0, 446.0], [201.0, 446.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不仅仅指善良、善意，也是源于内心深处最纯粹而柔韧的力量。它包括一切引导人们走向公平、正义、阳光、自由、爱的美好品质。", "block_bbox": [163, 463, 1008, 517], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 463.0], [1008.0, 463.0], [1008.0, 517.0], [163.0, 517.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "扬善——", "block_bbox": [201, 553, 298, 577], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 553.0], [297.0, 553.0], [297.0, 576.0], [201.0, 576.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "尊重真理和自然法则，将“善”的美好的东西融入进思想，体现在行为上！让人们活出勇敢、自由、个性的生命，让社会充满更加文明、温暖、幸福的正能量。", "block_bbox": [163, 592, 1011, 645], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 592.0], [1011.0, 592.0], [1011.0, 645.0], [163.0, 645.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[06]", "block_bbox": [574, 718, 611, 737], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 718.0], [610.0, 718.0], [610.0, 736.0], [574.0, 736.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "公平——", "block_bbox": [239, 901, 334, 925], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 901.0], [333.0, 901.0], [333.0, 924.0], [239.0, 924.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "尊重自然法则，在此基础上让所有的人付出和回报成正比。", "block_bbox": [239, 942, 702, 965], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 942.0], [702.0, 942.0], [702.0, 965.0], [239.0, 965.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "自由---", "block_bbox": [239, 1002, 334, 1025], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1002.0], [333.0, 1002.0], [333.0, 1024.0], [239.0, 1024.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "以不违背法律和人性的道德标准为底线，以突出善良和个性为原则，不接受束缚，既不束缚自己、更不束缚他人，保持对每个生命、每个物质的尊重和敬畏。在此基础上，从精神思想的自由，落实到行为自由。", "block_bbox": [199, 1038, 1048, 1091], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1038.0], [1048.0, 1038.0], [1048.0, 1091.0], [199.0, 1091.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "尊重——", "block_bbox": [238, 1129, 334, 1152], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1129.0], [333.0, 1129.0], [333.0, 1151.0], [238.0, 1151.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "接受万事万物的本性，理解并共同向崇善的方向发展而不是指责。", "block_bbox": [238, 1169, 756, 1191], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1169.0], [756.0, 1169.0], [756.0, 1191.0], [238.0, 1191.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "信任——", "block_bbox": [238, 1240, 334, 1264], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1240.0], [333.0, 1240.0], [333.0, 1263.0], [238.0, 1263.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "相信、支持、成就、认可，最大限度地给予自己和他人成长和实现目标的机会。", "block_bbox": [238, 1281, 863, 1305], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1281.0], [863.0, 1281.0], [863.0, 1305.0], [238.0, 1305.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "真诚——", "block_bbox": [239, 1346, 334, 1370], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1345.9998779296875], [333.0, 1345.9998779296875], [333.0, 1368.9998779296875], [239.0, 1368.9998779296875]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "真实、坦诚地对己对人，不违心地做人做事，拒绝虚伪。", "block_bbox": [239, 1387, 685, 1410], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1387.0], [685.0, 1387.0], [685.0, 1410.0], [239.0, 1410.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[07]", "block_bbox": [611, 1478, 650, 1497], "block_id": 19, "block_order": null, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1478.0], [649.0, 1478.0], [649.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5436078310012817, "coordinate": [165, 141, 395, 167], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [395.0, 141.0], [395.0, 167.0], [165.0, 167.0]]}, 